  "prefLabel": "Ed 1004.02 Participant Involvement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1004.02 Participant Involvement. NHVR shall encourage the greatest degree of independence and responsibility as desired by an individual. Individuals shall be encouraged to actively participate in developing their own IPEs, schedule their own appointments, complete investigatory assignments, and perform other tasks with the full support and guidance of their counselors, as needed.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
